<title>JAPAN: Nissan Construction -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nissan Construction -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 62.60		vs	   71.75</p>
<p> Operating	  871    million	  vs	    2.22</p>
<p> Current	    537    million	  vs	    1.74</p>
<p> Net		  163    million	  vs	  614    million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.91 yen	  vs	    7.20 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     85 million	  vs	  85 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.25 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nissan Construction Co Ltd is a contractor belonging to Nichii Co's Mycal group.</p>
</text>
